  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then the minimum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8838;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
  },
